 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" id=\"fs-idp140292160\" class=\"interactive ost-assessed-feature ost-tag-lo-apbio-ch34-s05-lo01\">\n<h3 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<p id=\"fs-idp3140864\">Visit <a href=\"https://openstax.org/l/embryo_fetus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">this site</a> to see the stages of human fetal development.</p>\n<div data-type=\"injected-exercise\" data-injected-from-nickname=\"\" data-injected-from-version=\"9\" data-injected-from-url=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/api/exercises?q=tag:apbio-ch34-ex057\" data-tags=\"apbio-ch34-s05-lo01 apbio-ch34-ex057 exid:apbio-ch34-ex057 context-cnxfeature:fs-idp140292160\" data-is-vocab=\"false\" data-question-count=\"1\" data-is-multipart=\"False\">\n    \n    <div data-type=\"exercise-question\" data-is-answer-order-important=\"true\" data-formats=\"free-response multiple-choice\" data-id=\"142455\" id=\"142455\"><div class=\"os-problem-container\">\n<div data-type=\"exercise-context\" data-context-module=\"299ab4d4-c488-440d-b8e0-eb7dca93faf9\" data-context-feature=\"fs-idp140292160\">Refer to <a class=\"autogenerated-content\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-ap-courses/pages/34-7-human-pregnancy-and-birth#fs-idp140292160\">[link]</a>\n</div>\n        <div data-type=\"question-stem\">In humans, by which week of gestation are all limbs and essential organs formed?</div>\n        <ol data-type=\"question-answers\" type=\"a\">\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-id=\"548393\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">5</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-id=\"548392\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">6</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-id=\"548391\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">7</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-id=\"548394\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">8</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            </ol>\n        </div></div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>",
